This fork is a game built on desktop-fly by Denis Shiryaev
(https://github.com/DenisSergeevitch/desktop-fly), MIT License — see LICENSE.
The fly, its 668-neuron FlyWire brain circuit, the 1,045-neuron MaleCNS leg
circuit, the body and the brain window are his work and are unchanged here
apart from the hooks listed in ENGINE.md.

Connectome data: FlyWire v783 (CC BY-NC 4.0) and MaleCNS v1.0 (CC BY 4.0).
Citations and terms in data/DATA_LICENSE.md and data/LOCOMOTOR_PROVENANCE.md.
The default data (data/) is FlyWire-derived and non-commercial. data-malecns/
is MaleCNS-derived (CC BY 4.0); a build made with `package.sh --malecns`
contains only that and carries no non-commercial restriction.

The game layer (Game/, Senses/, Audio/, packaging) is released under the same
MIT License.
